rlds with awesome characters\" and is now in a writers group, feeling motivated by inspirational people.\n  - director: Joanna hopes a director falls in love with her screenplay to get it on the big screen.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1469,"context_chars":6082,"retrieval_duration":0.24442791938781738,"response_duration":2.4220802783966064,"total_duration":2.666508197784424,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer captures the essence of Joanna's feelings about her characters coming alive, using similar positive descriptors, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to answer the question about Joanna's feelings on October 25, 2022, regarding her characters coming alive on the big screen. It explicitly states that Joanna found the experience of seeing her characters jump off the page and become real to be 'surreal and satisfying,' which aligns with the golden answer of 'surreal and cool.' Additionally, the context includes her reflections on the experience being amazing and rewarding, further supporting the completeness of the answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["surreal","satisfying","amazing","rewarding"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_78","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What was the necklace Calvin received meant to remind him of?","golden_answer":"why he keeps hustling as a musician","hypothesis":"The stunning necklace with a diamond pendant that Calvin observed was meant to remind him to keep hustling as a musician. This event occurred on May 1, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of