angements concerning dogs despite living in the city.","The doggy daycare has a large indoor space for dogs to play."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_2","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_2_qa_136","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What does John believe is important for children regarding veterans?","golden_answer":"Teaching them to respect and appreciate those who served","hypothesis":"John believes it is important to teach kids about veterans and what they did for the nation. He emphasizes the significance of showing respect and appreciation to those who served the country. This was expressed in a memory dated August 3, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - John is encouraging teaching kids about veterans and their service. (event_time: 2023-08-03T18:20:00Z)\n  - John thinks showing respect and appreciation to those who served our country is important. (event_time: 2023-08-03T18:20:00Z)\n  - It is important to teach kids about veterans and what they did for the nation. (event_time: 2023-08-03T18:20:00Z)\n  - John wants his kids to learn about unconditional love and loyalty. (event_time: 2023-06-03T11:51:00Z)\n  - John believes that a bit of joy is important. (event_time: 2023-05-04T15:18:00Z)\n  - John believes the work supporting military veterans is worthwhile and wants to express appreciation for their hard work. (event_time: 2023-05-20T19:38:00Z)\n  - John believes it is important to help people find what they need. (event_time: 2023-02-05T14:33:00Z)\