o Jolene used to bake cookies with her.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1314,"context_chars":4787,"retrieval_duration":0.20815157890319824,"response_duration":2.8533310890197754,"total_duration":3.0614826679229736,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions that Jolene has a snake, which aligns with the gold answer stating she has snakes.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides clear and specific information about Jolene's pets, particularly that she has snakes, including a pet named Susie who is identified as a snake. This directly answers the question about what pets Jolene has, aligning perfectly with the golden answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Jolene has a pet named Susie, who is a snake.","Jolene's pet is a snake.","Jolene possesses snakes for comfort."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_2","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_2_qa_144","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What activity did John and Max enjoy together last summer?","golden_answer":"Camping","hypothesis":"John and Max enjoyed hiking together last summer. This activity took place during their camping trip on August 1, 2022.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - John and Max had a camping trip together last summer. (event_time: 2022-08-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John and Max made great memories together during their camping trip last summer. (event_time: 2022-08-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Max participated in the camping trip with John last su